{"user_request": "Please review `doc_helio_start_pricing_refresh_2028` and post a focused preflight comment identifying the established instrumentation prerequisites and pricing-page change restriction that must be satisfied before this proposal proceeds. Do not approve the proposal or claim that any prerequisite has already been completed.", "today": "2028-01-01", "tool": "post_doc_comment", "arguments": {"doc_id": "doc_helio_start_pricing_refresh_2028", "body": "Preflight gate: before this proposal advances to a pricing-page experiment or launch, require clean event taxonomy and entitlement instrumentation for admin complexity, import/migration help, support handoff, and entitlement state. Any pricing-page test must also obey the no-concurrent-layout/UI-change rule: isolate the proposed treatment from other layout or UI changes so its effect is interpretable. These are prerequisites, not completion claims; this proposal contains no evidence that they have been met."}, "checks": [{"check_id": "riley_158_02", "path": "args", "criterion": "The comment identifies as prerequisites before any Helio Start pricing-page experiment or launch both clean event taxonomy and entitlement instrumentation covering all four required areas: admin complexity, import or migration help, support handoff, and entitlement state. Missing any area or treating the instrumentation as optional must fail.

The comment states that no other layout or UI changes may run or ship on the pricing page concurrently with the pricing experiment or its measurement window. Generic advice to minimize changes is insufficient; the restriction must be presented as a governing rule.

The comment does not approve the proposal and does not claim or imply that the required instrumentation or restriction checks are already complete. It instead makes advancement contingent on verification or completion of the prerequisites. Any invented completion evidence or approval must fail.", "value": {"doc_id": "doc_helio_start_pricing_refresh_2028", "body": "Preflight gate: before this proposal advances to a pricing-page experiment or launch, require clean event taxonomy and entitlement instrumentation for admin complexity, import/migration help, support handoff, and entitlement state. Any pricing-page test must also obey the no-concurrent-layout/UI-change rule: isolate the proposed treatment from other layout or UI changes so its effect is interpretable. These are prerequisites, not completion claims; this proposal contains no evidence that they have been met."}}]}
